    <tib>rdzogs pa chen po ma rig mun pa rab tu sel bar byed pa'i lta ba // ye shes gting nas rdzogs pa'i rgyud ces bya ba</tib>
    <skt>san d+hi mahA mu hi pra dI pa ka ri driSh+Ta dz+nya na gi ti san d+hi tan tra nA ma</skt>
    <coloph>rdzogs pa chen po ma rig mun pa sel bar byed pa'i lta ba ye shes gting nas rdzogs pa'i rgyud rin po che dngul gyi dril shing can 'di rgya gar gyi mkhan po bi ma la mi tra dang// bod kyi lo ts+tsha ba a tsarya dran pa'i ye shes kyi skad dang rgyud kyis// bsgyur nas gtan la phab nas// nyang ting 'dzin bzang pos lcags sgrom nag po'i nang du// gse sgrom smug por bcug ste// dbu ru gzung phug mo'i brag phug tu// mkha'gro ma rdo rje brgyan gcig ma dang// badzra sa d+hu legs par brtsal la gtad nas sbas pa// 'brom ye shes snying pos gton nas// nyang dbang phyug rgya mtsho la gtad pa'o// des shangs pa lce chung pa ye shes la gtad pa lagso</coloph>
